    "html": "<style>\n.fp{--ink:#14181f;--mut:#5b6472;--line:#e8ebf0;--acc:#1f6f5c;--soft:#f5f7f6;color:var(--ink);background:#fff;font-family:inherit}\n.fp *{box-sizing:border-box}.fp section{padding:72px 20px}.fp .w{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto}\n.fp h1{font-size:clamp(34px,6vw,60px);line-height:1.08;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:0 0 18px;text-align:center}\n.fp h2{font-size:clamp(26px,4vw,38px);line-height:1.15;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:0 0 14px}\n.fp p{color:var(--mut);font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;margin:0}\n.fp .c{text-align:center}.fp .c p{max-width:620px;margin:0 auto}\n.fp .btns{display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:28px}\n.fp .b{display:inline-block;padding:14px 26px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;border:2px solid var(--ink);color:var(--ink);background:#fff}\n.fp .b.p{background:var(--ink);color:#fff}.fp .b:hover{opacity:.85}\n.fp .ppl{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:clamp(12px,4vw,40px);margin-top:48px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.fp .pp{text-align:center;width:min(220px,28vw);min-width:130px}.fp .pp svg{width:100%;aspect-ratio:1;border-radius:28px;display:block}\n.fp .pp b{display:block;margin-top:12px;font-size:17px}.fp .pp span{color:var(--mut);font-size:14px}\n.fp .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:40px;align-items:center;padding:36px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}\n.fp .row:nth-child(even) .t{order:2}.fp .n{color:var(--acc);font-weight:700;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:10px}\n.fp .viz{background:var(--soft);border-radius:24px;min-height:200px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:64px}\n.fp .gr{background:var(--soft)}.fp .chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;justify-content:center;margin-top:28px}\n.fp .chips span{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:10px 18px;font-weight:600;font-size:15px}\n@media(max-width:760px){.fp .row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:18px}.fp .row:nth-child(even) .t{order:0}.fp section{padding:52px 18px}}\n</style><div class=\"fp\"><section class=\"c\"><div class=\"w\">\n<h1>La Partita IVA, finalmente semplice</h1>\n<p>Apertura, fatture, tasse e dichiarazione in un unico posto, con un commercialista vero accanto a te.</p>\n<div class=\"btns\"><a class=\"b p\" href=\"__BASEURL__/contatti/#inizia\">Parla con noi</a><a class=\"b\" href=\"#come-funziona\">Come funziona</a></div>\n<div class=\"ppl\"><div class=\"pp\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 120 120\" role=\"img\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"120\" height=\"120\" fill=\"#eef4f1\"/><path d=\"M14 120c2-24 20-34 46-34s44 10 46 34z\" fill=\"#1f6f5c\"/><rect x=\"52\" y=\"76\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#e8b894\"/><ellipse cx=\"60\" cy=\"56\" rx=\"21\" ry=\"25\" fill=\"#e8b894\"/><path d=\"M30 52c0-22 12-30 30-30s30 8 30 30c0 4-2 10-4 12 0-14-8-22-26-22s-26 8-26 22c-2-2-4-8-4-12z\" fill=\"#3a2a20\"/><path d=\"M42 78c4 12 32 12 36 0v6c-4 14-32 14-36 0z\" fill=\"#3a2a20\"/><circle cx=\"52\" cy=\"56\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#222\"/><circle cx=\"68\" cy=\"56\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#222\"/><path d=\"M50 68q10 10 20 0\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><b>Artigiano</b><span>Il tuo lavoro sono le mani, le carte le gestiamo noi</span></div><div class=\"pp\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 120 120\" role=\"img\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"120\" height=\"120\" fill=\"#eef1f6\"/><path d=\"M14 120c2-24 20-34 46-34s44 10 46 34z\" fill=\"#2b3a55\"/><rect x=\"52\" y=\"76\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#f1c9a8\"/><ellipse cx=\"60\" cy=\"56\" rx=\"21\" ry=\"25\" fill=\"#f1c9a8\"/><path d=\"M26 60c-2-26 10-38 34-38s36 12 34 38c0 14-2 26-6 34l-8-8V52c0-10-8-16-20-16s-20 6-20 16v34l-8 8c-4-8-6-20-6-34z\" fill=\"#6b3d1f\"/><circle cx=\"52\" cy=\"56\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#222\"/><circle cx=\"68\" cy=\"56\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#222\"/><path d=\"M50 68q10 10 20 0\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><b>Libero professionista</b><span>Consulenti, designer, sviluppatori, creator</span></div><div class=\"pp\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 120 120\" role=\"img\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"120\" height=\"120\" fill=\"#f6efe9\"/><path d=\"M14 120c2-24 20-34 46-34s44 10 46 34z\" fill=\"#a0522d\"/><rect x=\"52\" y=\"76\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#d79d74\"/><ellipse cx=\"60\" cy=\"56\" rx=\"21\" ry=\"25\" fill=\"#d79d74\"/><path d=\"M30 52c0-22 12-30 30-30s30 8 30 30c0 4-2 10-4 12 0-14-8-22-26-22s-26 8-26 22c-2-2-4-8-4-12z\" fill=\"#1c1c1c\"/><circle cx=\"52\" cy=\"56\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#222\"/><circle cx=\"68\" cy=\"56\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#222\"/><path d=\"M50 68q10 10 20 0\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><b>Commerciante</b><span>Negozio fisico o online, senza pensieri</span></div></div></div></section></div>"
